  "prefLabel": "Rev 301.32 Taxpayer identification number",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 301.32 “Taxpayer identification number” means:\n\n(a) Social Security number;\n\n(b) Federal employer identification number;\n\n(c) Individual taxpayer identification number;\n\n(d) Preparer tax identification number; or\n\n(e) Department identification number.\n\nSource. #5490, eff 10-19-92; ss by #6853, eff 9-23-98; ss by #8709, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10758, eff 1-16-15; renumbered by #12361 (from Rev 301.32) renumbered by #13177 (formerly Rev 301.31); ss by #14231, eff 4-3-25, EXPIRES 4-3-35",
